     "name_html": "Soy sauce (glaze)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Toasted sesame oil (glaze)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the miso, mirin and sugar. Grill the plain-rice triangles the same way (a little oil brushed on the parchment helps), until both sides are browned.</li><li>Heat to low, spread miso on top, flip and cook that side <b>10–15 seconds</b>; spread the other side, flip, 10–15 seconds. Miso burns very fast.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
